28:T4ff,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Are taxis available at AlUla airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"On-demand taxis are extremely limited at AlUla Airport (ULH). Pre-booking your transfer in advance is strongly recommended."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How far is AlUla airport from the resorts?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"About 30 km to the main resort area, roughly 30 minutes. Hegra is a further drive out of AlUla town; the driver confirms timing for your plan."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What vehicles are available at AlUla?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Executive sedans, full-size SUVs and vans through our partner network. Tell us your passengers and luggage and the vehicle is confirmed with the fare before you book."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you track my flight into ULH?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Share your flight number and a delay moves your pickup; 15–30 minutes of waiting after landing is free."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is meet & greet included at AlUla airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Meet & greet is provided at arrivals, and driver details are sent on WhatsApp before pickup."}}]}1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C] pb-24","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TaxiService\",\"name\":\"Airport Taxi Service at AlUla International Airport (ULH)\",\"description\":\"Private airport transfers from AlUla International Airport (ULH) to your desert resort, hotel or onward sights such as Hegra. Pre-booked, fare agreed before you travel; we track your flight.\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/airports/alula\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/#taxiservice\"},\"serviceType\":\"Airport Transfer\",\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Air